.TH "APP-PUT" "1" "2026-11-28" "app v1.2.3"
.SH "NAME"
app\-put \- put a file
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.PP
\fBapp put\fR [flags] [args]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
put a file
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show help, then exit
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR FILE
the config file (default: $HOME/.apprc)
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-debug\fR, \fB\-\-trace\fR
write debug output
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR string
the output format (default: json) (allowed: json, yaml)
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBapp\fR(1)
